{"overview":"«کنجی واتانابه» (شیمورا)، کارمند قدیمی بخش بایگانی شهرداری، در می‌یابد که به سرطان معده مبتلا شده و بیش از شش ماه دیگر زنده نمی‌ماند. او ابتدا می‌خواهد تا از آخرین روزهای زندگی‌اش لذت ببرد، اما این بی فایده است و «واتانابه» می‌میرد. در مراسم یادبودش، روشن می‌شود که پیش از مرگ یک زمین بازی برای بچه‌های محله ساخته است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kanji Watanabe is a middle-aged man who has worked in the same monotonous bureaucratic position for decades. Learning he has cancer, he starts to look for the meaning of his life.","tagline_en":"A big story of a little man which will grip your soul...","runtime":143,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["آکیرا کوروساوا"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"志村喬","role":"Kanji Watanabe","photo":"/ydyAm2vyBbEPZRICIMqqjDm0NM9.jpg"},{"name":"田中春男","role":"Sakai","photo":"/eziah9QZcIs3SVPgTS3iuyUpiW3.jpg"},{"name":"金子信雄","role":"Mitsuo, son of Kanji","photo":"/uKkx38oqe1VqAzVjpXslOPSTajW.jpg"},{"name":"左卜全","role":"Ohara","photo":"/kvISvHgKAAWVPOnDjgVHWOgSOaO.jpg"},{"name":"小田切みき","role":"Toyo","photo":"/9pfgepQ89gE9wZyHLnMM3tMRV1Y.jpg"},{"name":"日守新一","role":"Kimura","photo":"/uvdGhKmIIfjO705CqXAS13gO65X.jpg"},{"name":"千秋実","role":"Noguchi","photo":"/9E3efYEg8pxANdfVLqYGiX8zJE8.jpg"},{"name":"山田巳之助","role":"Subordinate Clerk Saito","photo":"/7X4YVArkGtjx8Hl6HSgxwWOI3zo.jpg"},{"name":"藤原釜足","role":"Sub-Section Chief Ono","photo":"/jf1aok2Ln5XG805BDzBJc2PjZQg.jpg"},{"name":"小堀誠","role":"Kiichi Watanabe, Kanji's Brother","photo":"/mD8nWCRjoOxsADpoBble9IEueOn.jpg"},{"name":"中村伸郎","role":"Deputy Mayor","photo":"/24r35Pf7V3CXaWbIo6LhWIKMISO.jpg"},{"name":"渡辺篤","role":"Patient","photo":"/s45tFh01BT7mCCwF7oz6IiEGqgC.jpg"}],"trailer":"geKhyNerWM8","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/3782/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeSyZ1KQZhIdvTdy4QHeWty.png"},{"n":"Criterion Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/32XVilXkVbrwV96O3N5i0rtuyd6.png"},{"n"